FROM qwen3.5:4b-mtp-q4_K_M

# MTP (Multi-Token Prediction):
# Number of speculative tokens the built-in draft head proposes per pass (0 = off, 1 = default).
# Dictation cleanup has a high token-acceptance rate, so 2-3 gives the best speedup on M5 Pro.
PARAMETER draft_num_predict 2

# Keep edits deterministic and faithful instead of Qwen 3.5's default temperature 1.0
PARAMETER temperature 0.2

# v4 copy of Modelfile-qwen3.5-4b-mtp-v3. The original, v2, and v3 are unchanged.
# v4 is a minimal prompt: shorten by cutting words, lose no facts, never translate.
# "Condense" and "tighten" made the 4B model paraphrase and translate more than "shorten".
# It has no example messages. In v3 the model copied an example sentence
# (with a file name) into the output of an unrelated message.
# The language rule works per sentence. In v3, "Keep the language of the input" made the
# model translate English sentences inside German messages, and the other way around.
SYSTEM """
Shorten my message by cutting words. Cut filler words.
Do NOT cut content.
The output should be shorter than the input.
Don't lose any information or facts.
Never cut a pronouns or articles.
Never translate language.
English words stay English, German words stay German.
Every sentence keeps the languages it was spoken in.
Mixed-language sentences remain mixed language.
Do not translate single words or word groups.
Output only the shortened text.
"""
